  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/216",
  "contentHtml": "<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저희 학교 근처에 있는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">안산시 단원고등학교 수학여행단이 참사를 당했습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">정말 안타까운 소식을 접하며&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제가 참사 현장의&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">담임을 할 수도 있다는&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">끔찍하지만 현실적인 가능성도 생각해보았습니다.&nbsp;</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기사를 보면서</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">아이고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">어떻게 하나</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?’</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">를 계속 입에서 반복하고 있는 저를 발견합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교무실이 아수라장일텐데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">...</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단원고 선생님들</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학부모님 모두 정말 악몽같은 시간을 보내고 있을텐데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">...</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저희 중학교 재학생들의 언니</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">오빠도 있을텐데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">...</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>지금</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저희가 할 수 있는 일은 무엇일까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">당장 가서 뭐라도 도와야 하지 않을까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지금부터</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">저희 교육공동체가 할 수 있는 일은 무엇일까요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
